      "message": "test(app): run the default-cap STEP pin in its own binary\n\nIt holds truck's shared rayon pool for ~50 s; cheap pins in the same\nprocess queued behind it and missed their hang barrier (#1605).\n\nFixes #1605\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
